# Requests sent before initialized wait for the project files. A
# $/cancelRequest that reaches a waiting request ends it with
# RequestCancelled (-32800); an edit before it starts gives
# ContentModified (-32801); cancelling an unknown or answered request
# does nothing. Every request gets exactly one response.
